sequenceDiagram
    participant Cliente as Cliente
    participant Bridge as Telegram Bridge
    participant Orch as Orquestrador IA
    participant Parser as Parser Natural Agenda
    participant ChatbotApi as API /api/telegram-chatbot
    participant Scheduling as TelegramChatbotSchedulingService
    participant Appointment as ServiceAppointmentService

    Cliente->>Bridge: Mensagem: "pode agendar 2 visitas quarta e sexta de manha"
    Bridge->>Orch: Processar linguagem natural e entidades
    Orch->>ChatbotApi: GET /service-requests/{id}/eligible-providers
    ChatbotApi->>Scheduling: GetEligibleProvidersAsync(clientId, requestId)
    Scheduling-->>ChatbotApi: Lista de prestadores elegiveis
    ChatbotApi-->>Orch: Providers priorizados
    Orch->>Parser: Parse(message, nowUtc)
    Parser-->>Orch: janelas UTC + quantidade de visitas
    Orch->>ChatbotApi: POST /context-snapshots (scheduling_provider_suggestions)
    Orch->>ChatbotApi: POST /actions (schedule_matching_lookup)

    Orch->>ChatbotApi: POST /service-requests/{id}/schedule-visits-batch
    ChatbotApi->>Scheduling: ScheduleVisitsAsync(batchRequest)
    loop para cada visita solicitada
        Scheduling->>Appointment: CreateAsync(clientId, "Client", window/provider)
        Appointment-->>Scheduling: Success ou erro (slot_unavailable, etc)
    end
    Scheduling-->>ChatbotApi: Resultado consolidado por visita
    ChatbotApi-->>Orch: payload success/parcial/falha
    Orch->>ChatbotApi: POST /context-snapshots (scheduling_batch_result)
    Orch->>ChatbotApi: POST /actions (schedule_batch_create)
    Orch-->>Bridge: Resposta natural com confirmacoes e replanejamento
    Bridge-->>Cliente: Conversa atualizada em tempo real
